ent/uploads/2024/12/2024-Editors-Choice-Cory-Benson_Leogang-bikepark-love-jpg.webp\"><img width=\"1500\" height=\"2000\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024-Editors-Choice-Cory-Benson_Leogang-bikepark-love-jpg.webp\" alt=\"2024 Cory's Editor's Choice Awards, The Epic Bike Park Leogang\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024-Editors-Choice-Cory-Benson_Leogang-bikepark-love-jpg.webp 1500w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024-Editors-Choice-Cory-Benson_Leogang-bikepark-love-225x300.webp 225w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024-Editors-Choice-Cory-Benson_Leogang-bikepark-love-90x120.webp 90w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024-Editors-Choice-Cory-Benson_Leogang-bikepark-love-768x1024.webp 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2024-Editors-Choice-Cory-Benson_Leogang-bikepark-love-1152x1536.webp 1152w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Or to just enjoy time with your family, mountain biking like I did back in <a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/bikerumor-editors-choice-2024-cory-best-bike-and-gear-awards/\" target=\"_blank\">my 2024 Editor’s Choice</a>…</p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/Intense_prototype_carbon_M16_DH_bike_driveside.jpg\"><img width=\"600\" height=\"450\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/Intense_prototype_carbon_M16_DH_bike_driveside-600x450.jpg\" alt=\"2015 Intense M16 Carbon prototype\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/Intense_prototype_carbon_M16_DH_bike_driveside-600x450.jpg 600w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/Intense_prototype_carbon_M16_DH_bike_driveside-120x90.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/Intense_prototype_carbon_M16_DH_bike_driveside-297x223.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/Intense_prototype_carbon_M16_DH_bike_driveside.jpg 1200w\" /></a><figcaption>2015 Intense M16 Carbon prototype</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/Cube_new-215-650b-DH-prototype_bare-aluminum_non-driveside.jpg\"><img width=\"600\" height=\"450\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/Cube_new-215-650b-DH-prototype_bare-aluminum_non-driveside-600x450.jpg\" alt=\"2015 Cube 215 prototype\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/Cube_new-215-650b-DH-prototype_bare-aluminum_non-driveside-600x450.jpg 600w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/Cube_new-215-650b-DH-prototype_bare-aluminum_non-driveside-120x90.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/Cube_new-215-650b-DH-prototype_bare-aluminum_non-driveside-297x223.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/Cube_new-215-650b-DH-prototype_bare-aluminum_non-driveside.jpg 1200w\" /></a><figcaption>2015 Cube 215 prototype</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/Trek-Session-RSL_Rachel-Atherton-pro-DH-bike_course-recon.jpg\"><img width=\"600\" height=\"400\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/Trek-Session-RSL_Rachel-Atherton-pro-DH-bike_course-recon-600x400.jpg\" alt=\"Rachel Atherton's 2016 Trek Session RSL\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/Trek-Session-RSL_Rachel-Atherton-pro-DH-bike_course-recon-600x400.jpg 600w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/Trek-Session-RSL_Rachel-Atherton-pro-DH-bike_course-recon-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/Trek-Session-RSL_Rachel-Atherton-pro-DH-bike_course-recon-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/Trek-Session-RSL_Rachel-Atherton-pro-DH-bike_course-recon-768x512.jpg 768w\" /></a><figcaption>Rachel Atherton’s 2016 Trek Session RSL</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/YT-Industries_Tues-CF-Pro_Aaron-Gwin_carbon-pro-DH-downhill-mountain-bike_number-plate.jpg\"><img width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/YT-Industries_Tues-CF-Pro_Aaron-Gwin_carbon-pro-DH-downhill-mountain-bike_number-plate-600x600.jpg\" alt=\"Aaron Gwin's 2016 YT Tues\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/YT-Industries_Tues-CF-Pro_Aaron-Gwin_carbon-pro-DH-downhill-mountain-bike_number-plate-600x600.jpg 600w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/YT-Industries_Tues-CF-Pro_Aaron-Gwin_carbon-pro-DH-downhill-mountain-bike_number-plate-120x120.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/YT-Industries_Tues-CF-Pro_Aaron-Gwin_carbon-pro-DH-downhill-mountain-bike_number-plate-297x297.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/YT-Industries_Tues-CF-Pro_Aaron-Gwin_carbon-pro-DH-downhill-mountain-bike_number-plate-768x768.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/YT-Industries_Tues-CF-Pro_Aaron-Gwin_carbon-pro-DH-downhill-mountain-bike_number-plate.jpg 1800w\" /></a><figcaption>Aaron Gwin’s 2016 YT Tues</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/Transition-TR11_200mm-carbon-GiddyUp-DH-downhill-mountain-bike-prototype_pro-bike-feature_Leogang-World-Cup_Tahnee-Seagrave_landing.jpg\"><img width=\"600\" height=\"450\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/Transition-TR11_200mm-carbon-GiddyUp-DH-downhill-mountain-bike-prototype_pro-bike-feature_Leogang-World-Cup_Tahnee-Seagrave_landing-600x450.jpg\" alt=\"Tahnee Seagrave's Transition TR11 prototype\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/Transition-TR11_200mm-carbon-GiddyUp-DH-downhill-mountain-bike-prototype_pro-bike-feature_Leogang-World-Cup_Tahnee-Seagrave_landing-600x450.jpg 600w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/Transition-TR11_200mm-carbon-GiddyUp-DH-downhill-mountain-bike-prototype_pro-bike-feature_Leogang-World-Cup_Tahnee-Seagrave_landing-120x90.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/Transition-TR11_200mm-carbon-GiddyUp-DH-downhill-mountain-bike-prototype_pro-bike-feature_Leogang-World-Cup_Tahnee-Seagrave_landing-297x223.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/Transition-TR11_200mm-carbon-GiddyUp-DH-downhill-mountain-bike-prototype_pro-bike-feature_Leogang-World-Cup_Tahnee-Seagrave_landing-768x576.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/Transition-TR11_200mm-carbon-GiddyUp-DH-downhill-mountain-bike-prototype_pro-bike-feature_Leogang-World-Cup_Tahnee-Seagrave_landing.jpg 1200w\" /></a><figcaption>Tahnee Seagrave’s Transition TR11 prototype</figcaption></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Or chasing pro &amp; prototype DH bikes for more than a decade. Check out a few from my first couple of years on the ground, for good measure.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Needless to say, I’ll be returning to Leogang regularly in the future, as well.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3>One-On-One Training with Elements Bike School</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_passive-and-active-jumps.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1536\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_passive-and-active-jumps-1536x1536.jpg\" alt=\"Leogang training with Elements Bike School: jump techniques\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_passive-and-active-jumps-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_passive-and-active-jumps-297x297.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_passive-and-active-jumps-120x120.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_passive-and-active-jumps-768x768.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_passive-and-active-jumps-900x900.jpg 900w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_passive-and-active-jumps.jpg 1800w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_on-the-magic-carpet.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1536\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_on-the-magic-carpet-1536x1536.jpg\" alt=\"Leogang training with Elements Bike School: magic carpet\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_on-the-magic-carpet-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_on-the-magic-carpet-297x297.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_on-the-magic-carpet-120x120.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_on-the-magic-carpet-768x768.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_on-the-magic-carpet-900x900.jpg 900w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_on-the-magic-carpet.jpg 1800w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_on-the-trail.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1536\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_on-the-trail-1536x1536.jpg\" alt=\"Leogang training with Elements Bike School: on the trail lesson\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_on-the-trail-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_on-the-trail-297x297.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_on-the-trail-120x120.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_on-the-trail-768x768.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_on-the-trail-900x900.jpg 900w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Leogang-training-with-Elements-Bike-School_on-the-trail.jpg 1800w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>One of the big draws for us to head to Leogang on this particular weekend was a planned Ladies Gravity Camp training day being planned by Elements Bike School, the bike trainers located just under the main lift station in the bikepark. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>The idea seemed solid. Getting a group of advanced women riders together to hone their skills, hitting various natural and built-up obstacles in the bikepark to take it to the next level.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The hiccup, according to Elements, is that ever since COVID, most people coming to them to train want individual lessons, not group sessions. I asked my wife and she pretty much agreed. She’d much rather spend some one-on-one time with an instructor than worry about getting grouped with riders below her level that might keep her from progressing.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>But the good news is <em>(woman-owned)</em> Elements still offers multiple training options for men and women. And group training is still on offer for those who want it. But they’re super flexible with individual and small group training sessions, too.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Veronika-dropping-in-with-Elements-Bike-School.jpg\"><img width=\"2127\" height=\"1064\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Veronika-dropping-in-with-Elements-Bike-School.jpg\" alt=\"Veronika dropping in with Elements Bike School at Leogang\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Veronika-dropping-in-with-Elements-Bike-School.jpg 2127w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Veronika-dropping-in-with-Elements-Bike-School-297x149.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Veronika-dropping-in-with-Elements-Bike-School-1536x768.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Veronika-dropping-in-with-Elements-Bike-School-120x60.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Veronika-dropping-in-with-Elements-Bike-School-768x384.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Veronika-dropping-in-with-Elements-Bike-School-2048x1024.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Veronika-dropping-in-with-Elements-Bike-School-1600x800.jpg 1600w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>So, we went personal and met with Laura. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>She focused on a few key techniques that my wife Veronika wanted to improve on… Form &amp; on-bike positioning on passive to active drops, then working on balancing higher-speed berming techniques so left turns were as smooth as right turns. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Elements has multiple levels of both men and women coaching riders of all levels. And we came away from a relaxed 2-hour session feeling like progress was made, and there was still plenty to work on.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><em><a href=\"https://elements-outdoorsports.at/\" target=\"_blank\">Elements-outdoorsports.at</a></em></p>\n\n\n\n<h3>Bike Festival in Leogang this weekend – October 2-4, 2026!</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Bike-Festival-comes-to-Leogang-this-weekend.jpg\"><img width=\"2100\" height=\"1400\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Bike-Festival-comes-to-Leogang-this-weekend.jpg\" alt=\"Epic Bikepark Leogang 25 Years: Bike Festival this weekend\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Bike-Festival-comes-to-Leogang-this-weekend.jpg 2100w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Bike-Festival-comes-to-Leogang-this-weekend-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Bike-Festival-comes-to-Leogang-this-weekend-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Bike-Festival-comes-to-Leogang-this-weekend-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Bike-Festival-comes-to-Leogang-this-weekend-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Bike-Festival-comes-to-Leogang-this-weekend-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Bike-Festival-comes-to-Leogang-this-weekend-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Bike-Festival-comes-to-Leogang-this-weekend-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Bike-Festival-comes-to-Leogang-this-weekend-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Now, if you want to get some bigger group riding or new bike testing on, this weekend might be your ticket.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Bike Festival Leogang kicks off this weekend at the bikepark, starting today through Sunday.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>There’s a whole lot on the events calendar, including a lot of opportunities for you all to check out or test new bikes and gear in the bikepark, join in on several scheduled rides with local pros, and even get in some of your own skills training sessions with Bike Academy, too. There are lots of events for the whole family, as well. Plus, “<em>All festival visitors will receive a 10% discount on lift tickets throughout the entire festival weekend</em>,”  so you can ride the park for even less this weekend.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Check out the full details via the Saalfelden-Leogang region tourism board site: </p>\n\n\n\n<p><em><a href=\"https://www.saalfelden-leogang.com/en/news-events/events/bike-festival-saalfelden-leogang\" target=\"_blank\">Saalfelden-Leogang.com</a></em></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Oh, and one last thing…</p>\n\n\n\n<h3>25th Anniversary Photo Contest means free trail cams</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Cory-on-Flying-Gangster.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1536\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Cory-on-Flying-Gangster-1536x1536.jpg\" alt=\"25th Anniversary Photo Contest: Flying Gangster trail cam\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Cory-on-Flying-Gangster-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Cory-on-Flying-Gangster-297x297.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Cory-on-Flying-Gangster-120x120.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Cory-on-Flying-Gangster-768x768.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Cory-on-Flying-Gangster-900x900.jpg 900w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Cory-on-Flying-Gangster.jpg 1800w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Cory-on-Flow-Link.jpg\"><img width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Cory-on-Flow-Link.jpg\" alt=\"25th Anniversary Photo Contest: Flow Link trail cam\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Cory-on-Flow-Link.jpg 1200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Cory-on-Flow-Link-297x297.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Cory-on-Flow-Link-120x120.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Cory-on-Flow-Link-768x768.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Cory-on-Flow-Link-900x900.jpg 900w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Veronika-on-Hangman-II.jpg\"><img width=\"1536\" height=\"1536\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Veronika-on-Hangman-II-1536x1536.jpg\" alt=\"25th Anniversary Photo Contest: Hangman II trail cam\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Veronika-on-Hangman-II-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Veronika-on-Hangman-II-297x297.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Veronika-on-Hangman-II-120x120.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Veronika-on-Hangman-II-768x768.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Veronika-on-Hangman-II-900x900.jpg 900w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25th-Anniversary-Photo-Contest_Veronika-on-Hangman-II.jpg 1800w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Running through the end of the season until the start of November, Leogang is running a 25th anniversary photo contest via social media. </p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://bikepark.saalfelden-leogang.com/en/events/25years-bikepark-leogang/photo-contest\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Enter to win some sick kit here</em></a><em> </em>– including a new Scott Gambler DH bike for one man <em>and</em> one woman. Plus, the side benefit is that all three of their automatic trail cameras that snap your photo as you ride past are available for free to download. You just search the time you pass each trail location – the Flying Gangster wall ride, the Flow Link hip jump, and the lower Hangman II berm.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Go ride, then download your snaps to check out your form!</p>\n\n\n\n<p><em><a href=\"https://bikepark.saalfelden-leogang.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Bikepark.Saalfelden-Leogang.com</a></em></p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>","author":"Cory Benson","comments":"https://bikerumor.com/25-years-of-epic-bikepark-leogang-skills-with-elements-bike-festival-this-weekend/#respond","siteTitle":"Bikerumor","siteHash":"49f427af0a926f4232eb837006841d7242e153e3afbb590f32e4b104ea3e2718","entryHash":"fc857dc6a16ef2d8a6f8a2236c262c23c61093a43fd6337d4f75b2dae7d63069","category":"Cycling"}